/// known-gap: interp does not enforce the colon rule; the interpreter is being retired (VM only, 0.51.26)
/// Owner ruling 2026-11-11: a variable that holds a function may share a builtin's name; `upper(...)` calls the variable.
act exclaim(s)
    send s + "!"
xx
upper | exclaim
:say(upper("a"))
:say(:upper("a"))
